# #132 Dreadlord's Sleep, native check by parity: an airborne Sleep lasts 24; a shield stops Sleep; a
# grounded Sleep lasts its full length unmashed; mashing wakes the sleeper early, never before frame
# 24. Each Sleep lands as the 240 frames of immunity from the one before run out. A hit waking the
# sleeper and Vampiric Pounce are dreadlord-pounce.pad. Dreadlord a against Dreadlord b; syntax and
# checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero dreadlord
# a dashes in, inside Sleep's reach.
40 a stick 1 0
42 a stick 0 0
# Sleep on b just as b hops: an airborne Sleep, 24 frames; b attacks right after it.
60 a stick 0 -1
60 a tap X 2
61 a stick 0 0
106 b tap B 2
136 b tap A 2
# Sleep into b's held shield: no hit.
160 a stick 0 -1
160 a tap X 2
161 a stick 0 0
170 b shield 1
250 b shield 0
# Sleep on a grounded b, unmashed: b waits through all 100 frames before attacking.
330 a stick 0 -1
330 a tap X 2
331 a stick 0 0
484 b tap A 2
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
# Sleep again once b's immunity is over; b mashes attack every 4 frames.
670 a stick 0 -1
670 a tap X 2
671 a stick 0 0
721 b tap A 2
725 b tap A 2
729 b tap A 2
733 b tap A 2
737 b tap A 2
741 b tap A 2
745 b tap A 2
749 b tap A 2
753 b tap A 2
757 b tap A 2
761 b tap A 2
765 b tap A 2
769 b tap A 2
773 b tap A 2
777 b tap A 2
781 b tap A 2
#! expect a 60 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 110 damage 2.000
#! expect b 136 applied attack 1 style 0
#! expect a 160 special 16 form 0
#! absent b 161-379 damage
#! expect a 330 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 380 damage 4.000
#! absent b 381-483 applied attack
#! expect b 484 applied attack 2 style 0
#! expect a 670 special 16 form 0
#! expect b 720 damage 6.000
#! absent b 721-755 applied attack
#! expect b 757 applied attack 3 style 0
#! scene a SleepSpecialArt
#! scene a VoidWalkerMissile
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
